  "note": "Erratum: With the printed S_{0,v} = Σ_{n|v} Λ(n)e(αn)η(n/x), (3.11) is false: the remainder must be Σ_{(n,v)>1} Λ(n)e(αn)η(n/x), which also contains the prime powers p^k, k ≥ 2, p | v; for η = η₂, v = 2, α = 0 the omitted terms total 4(log 2)² ≈ 1.92 (e.g. X = 100: S_η = 99.1255 against 97.2037 + 0) (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_3_11.py`)."
